            <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> About The Journal</h2>
            <div class="c-box">
              <p>The <strong>ScriptHive Global Journal of Engineering and Technology Research (SGJETR)</strong> is a peer-reviewed, open-access international journal dedicated to publishing pioneering research in engineering, technology development, and applied science. The journal provides a credible platform for engineering professionals, academicians, and technical researchers to disseminate new scientific ideas and technical methodologies.</p>
              <p>SGJETR recognises that technological innovation is the driving force behind modern societal advancement. The journal values both empirical studies and theoretical frameworks that address engineering problems, propose efficient systems, or advance software development paradigms.</p>
              <p>The journal ensures clinical and engineering precision through a rigorous double-blind peer review process conducted by a global panel of domain experts. SGJETR is published quarterly, aiming for quick dissemination of technological advancements.</p>
              <div class="highlight-box">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-check"></i>
                <p>Double-Blind Peer Review + 100% Open Access Publishing</p>
