          <!-- Publication Ethics -->
          <section id="ethics" class="c-section gs-reveal-up">
            <h2><i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced"></i> Publication Ethics</h2>
            <div class="c-box">

              <!-- Plagiarism Policy -->
              <div style="margin-bottom: 36px; position: relative; z-index: 1;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
                  <div style="width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved" style="color: #ef4444; font-size: 1.2rem;"></i>
                  </div>
                  <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark); margin: 0;">Plagiarism Policy</h3>
                </div>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">All submitted manuscripts are screened for plagiarism using industry-standard detection tools. A similarity index above <strong style="color: var(--text-dark);">15%</strong> results in immediate rejection without review.</p>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">All forms of plagiarism — including self-plagiarism — are strictly prohibited and constitute grounds for permanent disqualification.</p>
              </div>

              <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); margin-bottom: 32px;">

              <!-- Peer Review -->
              <div style="margin-bottom: 36px; position: relative; z-index: 1;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
                  <div style="width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(37,99,235,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.15); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user-secret" style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.2rem;"></i>
                  </div>
                  <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark); margin: 0;">Peer Review</h3>
                </div>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">SGJETR employs a rigorous <strong style="color: var(--text-dark);">double-blind peer review</strong> process conducted by at least two independent subject-matter experts.</p>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;">
                  <span style="background: rgba(16,185,129,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.2); color: #065f46; padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" style="color: #10b981;"></i> Accept</span>
                  <span style="background: rgba(37,99,235,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.15); color: var(--primary); padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-pen" style="color: var(--primary);"></i> Minor Revision</span>
                  <span style="background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,0.25); color: #92400e; padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-pen-to-square" style="color: var(--gold);"></i> Major Revision</span>
                  <span style="background: rgba(239,68,68,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.15); color: #991b1b; padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-xmark" style="color: #ef4444;"></i> Reject</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); margin-bottom: 32px;">

              <!-- Author Responsibilities -->
              <div style="position: relative; z-index: 1;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
                  <div style="width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(16,185,129,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user-pen" style="color: var(--brand-shield); font-size: 1.2rem;"></i>
                  </div>
                  <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-dark); margin: 0;">Author Responsibilities</h3>
                </div>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Authors submitting to SGJETR must adhere to the following ethical obligations:</p>
                <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
                  <li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" style="color: var(--brand-shield); margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
                    Originality and non-duplication of submission across journals.
                  </li>
                  <li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" style="color: var(--brand-shield); margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
                    Accurate declaration of all contributing authors and their specific contributions.
                  </li>
                  <li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" style="color: var(--brand-shield); margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
                    Full disclosure of any conflicts of interest relevant to the research.
                  </li>
                  <li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" style="color: var(--brand-shield); margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
                    Declaration of all required ethical approvals for human or animal studies.
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top: 32px;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-gavel"></i>
                <p>SGJETR strictly adheres to COPE (Committee on Publication Ethics) guidelines for all editorial decisions.</p>
              </div>

            </div>
          </section>

